    {
      "text": "%md\n*Why does`2015 Canada GDP` query take so long? and how can you optimize it.*\n- Hive scans **all rows (~millions)** because no partition or columnar optimization exists.\n- CSV parsing overhead adds latency.\n\n*Optimization options:*\n\n- Partition by `year`\n- Convert to Parquet/ORC\n- Run in SparkSQL (distributed in-memory)",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2025-09-03T03:38:08+0000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "tableHide": false,
        "editorSetting": {
