      "results": {
        "code": "SUCCESS",
        "msg": [
          {
            "type": "HTML",
            "data": "<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<p><em>Why does<code>2015 Canada GDP</code> query take so long? and how can you optimize it.</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Hive scans <strong>all rows (~millions)</strong> because no partition or columnar optimization exists.</li>\n<li>CSV parsing overhead adds latency.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>Optimization options:</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Partition by <code>year</code></li>\n<li>Convert to Parquet/ORC</li>\n<li>Run in SparkSQL (distributed in-memory)</li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>"
          }
        ]
      },
